hgzRead("🌿 Asleep", hgQs("There grew two olives, closest of the grove,\nWith roots entwined, the branches interwove;", "Hid in dry foliage thus Ulysses lies,\nTill Pallas pour'd soft slumbers on his eyes;\nAnd golden dreams (the gift of sweet repose)\nLull'd all his cares, and banish'd all his woes.") + hgSrc(hgBk(5)), "▶ To Book VI")
