hgzId("boast", hgzSay("Odysseus", "Odysseus, from the ship, shouting back at the cliff", "📣 Say it was Ulysses", ["'Cyclop! if any, pitying thy disgrace.\nAsk, who disfigured thus that eyeless face?\nSay 'twas Ulysses: 'twas his deed declare,\nLaertes' son, of Ithaca the fair;"], hgBk(9))),
hgzRead("🔱 The curse", hgQs("These words the Cyclop's burning rage provoke;\nFrom the tall hill he rends a pointed rock;") + "<p>And Polyphemus prays to his father Poseidon: let Odysseus never come home; or if he must, let him come late, alone, in a stranger's ship, and find trouble in his house. Poseidon hears.</p>" + hgSrc(hgBk(9)), "▶ To Book X")
