hgzId("marshal", hgzGo(hgA("trIlus", 0, -14), "Out through the gate to the mound in the plain, where the Trojans and their allies form up", { r: 10 })),
hgzRead("⛰️ The mound", hgQs("Amidst the plain, in sight of Ilion, stands\nA rising mount, the work of human hands;\n(This for Myrinne's tomb the immortals know,\nThough call'd Bateia in the world below;)") + hgQs("The godlike Hector, high above the rest,\nShakes his huge spear, and nods his plumy crest:") + hgSrc(hgBk(2)), "▶ Go on"),
hgzRead("🛡️ The allies", hgQs("Divine Æneas brings the Dardan race,\nAnchises' son, by Venus' stolen embrace,") + "<p>Pandarus with the men of Zeleia under Ida; Thracians from the shores of the Hellespont; Paeonians with their curved bows; and last of all,</p>" + hgQs("Which blameless Glaucus and Sarpedon lead\nThe warlike bands that distant Lycia yields,\nWhere gulfy Xanthus foams along the fields.") + hgSrc(hgBk(2)), "▶ To Book III")
