state: { env: "aegean" },
words: "The gods have left the field and the men fight on alone. The Trojans are driven back almost to their gates. Hector's brother Helenus the seer tells him: go up into the city, and tell our mother to take her finest robe to Athena's temple. Hector goes; and so do you, because a herald is wanted.",
intro: "The plain of the Scamander",
