hgzRead("💤 Diomedes", "<p>Nobody speaks. Then Diomedes says: you should never have begged him. Let him go or stay as he likes. Now sleep; and at dawn, Agamemnon, lead us out in front of the ships, and fight in the front yourself.</p>" + hgSrc(hgBk(9)), "▶ To Book X")
