state: { env: "aegean", flood: true },
words: "Ten years have come and gone. Asclepius has gone to work his cures, Heracles to his labours, Peleus has married a sea-nymph. And Jason is grown to be a mighty man. Today he stands on the mountain with Cheiron, and looks north and south and east and west.",
intro: "High on Pelion, over the cave",
