hgzReadA("🐬 Thetis and her nymphs", hgQs("Then out of the depths came Thetis, Peleus’ silver-footed bride, for love of her gallant husband, and all her nymphs around her; and they played like snow-white dolphins, diving on from wave to wave, before the ship, and in her wake, and beside her, as dolphins play.") + hgQs("And when Scylla stooped to seize her, they struck back her ravening heads, and foul Scylla whined, as a whelp whines, at the touch of their gentle hands.") + hgSrc(hgzKp(5)), hgQs("Then out of the depths came Thetis, Peleus’ silver-footed bride, for love of her gallant husband, and all her nymphs around her; and they played like snow-white dolphins, diving on from wave to wave, before the ship, and in her wake, and beside her, as dolphins play.") + "<p>They pass the ship from hand to hand like a ball, and when Scylla reaches out from her cave they push her back, and the Argo leaps safe past.</p>" + hgSrc(hgzKp(5)), "▶ To the next part")
