hgzRead("🏆 Twelve labours", hkV(["To crown his deeds, so wondrous & so great,"]) + "<p>The lion, the Hydra, the hind, the boar, the stables, the birds, the bull, the mares, the girdle, the oxen, the apples, and the dog of Hades. Twelve labours, and you were there for every one.</p>", "▶ Go on")
